      <activity id="244a8768-6178-5891-bdb4-bac4734bf2d4" activityNameId="b11192f9-3390-5aa1-9996-8b0158f97aee" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">N-methyl-2-pyrrolidone, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: N-methyl-2-pyrrolidone, at plant
The process "N-methyl-2-pyrrolidone, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  N-methyl-2-pyrrolidone  from butyrolactone in Europe.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation, Energy consumptions,  emissions, infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000872-50-4; 
Formula: C5H9NO; 
UUID: 9c355423-227a-34b7-a255-e9103c335d95
Production of N-methyl-2-pyrrolidone including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Methamination of butyrolactone
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9c355423-227a-34b7-a255-e9103c335d95.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
